QUEUE: It follows FIFO (First In First Out).

1.PriorityQueue
--> It Stores elements based on priority/sorted order.

Syntax :
PriorityQueue<DataType> objectName = new PriorityQueue<>();

Simple Code :

import java.util.PriorityQueue;
public class Main
{
    public static void main(String[] args)
    {
        PriorityQueue<Integer> pq = new PriorityQueue<>();
        pq.add(30);
        pq.add(10);
        pq.add(20);
        System.out.println(pq);
    }
}

Output :
[10, 30, 20] //Smallest element gets highest priority.

