| PriorityQueue | Partial | Yes        | Priority Based |
| HashMap       | No      | Keys No    |                |
| LinkedHashMap | Yes     | Keys No    |                |
| TreeMap       | Sorted  | Keys No    |                |
| Hashtable     | No      | Keys No    |                |

